Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3, python3-jinja2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian installer
 Installs HyprDebian on the disks of a computer, from a live system. It asks
 all its questions first, then runs the installation as a tree of tasks; a
 rerun after a failure continues where the last run stopped.
